cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HNQAP, please cite the release you used."
title: "HNQAP: Heat Network Quality Assurance Publications"
abstract: >-
  An open data standard for heat network monitoring: a six-level MQTT
  address for every data point (HNQAP-MQTT), a vocabulary of point names
  with fixed types and units, a table of monitoring points, and a reference
  of heat network KPIs per element type with thresholds and calculations.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Heatweb Solutions Ltd"
    website: "https://heatweb.co.uk"
repository-code: "https://github.com/heatweb/HNQAP"
url: "https://hnqap.org"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-25"
keywords:
  - heat networks
  - district heating
  - key performance indicators
  - HNTAS
  - MQTT
  - building management systems
  - data standard
